  "body": "There must be a `if not hs.config.account_validity.enabled: return` somewhere in one of the functions called (directly and indirectly) by the endpoint, which means that a call to [`/_synapse/admin/v1/account_validity/validity`](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/master/docs/admin_api/account_validity.rst#renew-account) will result in the same response as if the feature was enabled.",
